 Kazamachi, who has the second scroll. With Tenzen leading, some members of the Iga clan plan to make sure no news of the start of war spreads to the Kouga.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-04-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hQJgpRKieQOM8d4zCwTA6tOQxR2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hQJgpRKieQOM8d4zCwTA6tOQxR2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/9410/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"406933","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Thinking peace will soon come, Gennosuke and Udono celebrate with Oboro and the Igas. However the Iga clan plans to assassinate Gennosuke and Udono during the feast.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-05-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6byNDT3Bbdcofs71wj58Wo8C2Hi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6byNDT3Bbdcofs71wj58Wo8C2Hi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/9410/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"406934","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Kouga clan are concerned with Gennosuke stating at Tsubagakure, even they were informed about the peace treaty. They weren't informed about the war that has arise between the clans. Saemon decides to send his younger sister, Okoi to find Gennosuke.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-05-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4lQDQiVwBHMJG46VoX8QEkPKvbP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4lQDQiVwBHMJG46VoX8QEkPKvbP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/9410/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"406935","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"