ng the way.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-05-31","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hi6qeVqEnRMEF8sR6WjXgKmMQpa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hi6qeVqEnRMEF8sR6WjXgKmMQpa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/9410/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"406938","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the scroll now in Gennosuke's possession, he makes the decision to either engage in war or not. However, with being attacked by Koshiro and the other deadly ninjas, Gennosuke may have a hard time getting out of the village.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-06-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A9NWCd7fOwx2iT6rXvMcUIyw6qn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A9NWCd7fOwx2iT6rXvMcUIyw6qn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/9410/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"406939","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Two woman who hate each other and a little boy could possibly be linked to why the Iga and Kouga hate each other this moment..","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2005-06-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sday82nUEgf2msuXjPZA489mryd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sday82nUEgf2msuXjPZA489mryd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/9410/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"406940","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Gennosuke returns the scroll to the Iga and issues a challenge that if they attack the Kouga village they will annihilated. The people 